      "claim": "The evidence shows a suspicious execution chain on Maria's workstation: a downloaded macro-enabled document, hidden encoded PowerShell retrieving a remote script, and subsequent DLL execution. This is not the documented workstation-patching procedure, which is performed remotely by IT from WS-OHADDAD-01.",
